# Normalise to LF in the repo. The build runs on Linux (Vercel), so keeping
# CRLF out of committed sources avoids noisy diffs and tooling differences.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico  binary
